"caps": [
{
"text": "How does a *nuclear submarine* work?",
"start": 0.2,
"end": 3.4
},
{
"text": "It can hide underwater for *months*!",
"start": 3.7,
"end": 6.9
},
{
"text": "*Ballast tanks* fill up with *seawater*...",
"start": 7.2,
"end": 10.9
},
{
"text": "...the sub gets heavy and *sinks*.",
"start": 11.2,
"end": 14.9
},
{
"text": "*Diving planes* steer it down.",
"start": 15.2,
"end": 18.9
},
{
"text": "Down here there's *no air* to burn fuel...",
"start": 19.2,
"end": 22.4
},
{
"text": "...so it runs on a *nuclear reactor*.",
"start": 22.7,
"end": 25.9
},
{
"text": "The fuel rods are full of *uranium*.",
"start": 26.2,
"end": 29.9
},
{
"text": "A *neutron* smashes a uranium atom...",
"start": 30.2,
"end": 32.9
},
{
"text": "...it *splits* and fires out more neutrons!",
"start": 33.2,
"end": 35.9
},
{
"text": "A *chain reaction*! It all turns into *heat*.",
"start": 36.2,
"end": 40.9
},
{
"text": "*Control rods* soak up neutrons...",
"start": 41.2,
"end": 44.4
},
{
"text": "...push them in and the reaction *slows*. Drop them all: *STOP!*",
"start": 44.7,
"end": 47.9
},
{
"text": "Super hot water loops through the core. *High pressure* stops it boiling.",
"start": 48.2,
"end": 53.9
},
{
"text": "The *steam generator* passes the heat on...",
"start": 54.2,
"end": 56.9
},
{
"text": "...and a second loop boils into *steam*.",
"start": 57.2,
"end": 59.9
},
{
"text": "Steam spins the *turbines* super fast.",
"start": 60.2,
"end": 65.9
},
{
"text": "*Gears* slow that spin down...",
"start": 66.2,
"end": 69.9
},
{
"text": "...to turn the *propeller*. Water goes back, sub goes *forward*!",
"start": 70.2,
"end": 75.9
},
{
"text": "The power also makes *fresh water* and *oxygen* for the crew.",
"start": 76.2,
"end": 81.9
},
{
"text": "It stays *silent*, and listens with *sonar*.",
"start": 82.2,
"end": 86.9
},
{
"text": "The fuel lasts *30+ years*...",
"start": 87.2,
"end": 89.9
},
{
"text": "...the real limit? The *food*.",
"start": 90.2,
"end": 92.9
},
{
"text": "To go up, *air* blasts the water out!",
"start": 93.2,
"end": 96.4
},
{
"text": "*Splash!*",
"start": 96.7,
"end": 99.9
},
{
"text": "Follow for more *how things work*!",
"start": 100.2,
"end": 104.9
}
]
